    <h1>Keep the frame. Replace the cushions.</h1>
    <p class="lede">Most solid patio furniture outlives its pads. PatioReseat is an independent English-language guide to measuring what you have, reading outdoor fabric claims, and finding official or custom replacements for named collections.</p>
