<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="note">
      <p><strong>We do not invent dimensions.</strong> Manufacturer catalogs often list overall furniture width, depth, and height. Those are not cushion sizes. If a brand has not published a replacement-cushion size, we say so and send you to a tape measure — and, where the brand offers it, to a model-ID or retailer path.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

